        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6be1442b-bb6c-5b0e-a557-069544ef53d1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nellee Hooper, Baz Luhrmann, Björk, Marius De Vries, Madonna\n- Works: Bedtime Story, Red Curtain Trilogy, Strictly Ballroom, Romeo + Juliet, Moulin Rouge!\n- Roles: producer, remixer, composer, film director, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Baz Luhrmann was born on 17 September 1962 and is an Australian film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Nellee Hooper was born on 15 March 1963 and is a British producer, remixer, and composer.\n- Nellee Hooper became known for work with many major recording artists beginning in the late 1980s.\n- Baz Luhrmann is best known for the Red Curtain Trilogy, which comprises Strictly Ballroom (1992), Romeo + Juliet (1996), and Moulin Rouge!.\n- Bedtime Story was written by Björk, Nellee Hooper, and Marius De Vries for Madonna.\n- Bedtime Story was the only time Björk wrote a song for a Madonna album.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
